<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Music videos &#8211; Lengths vary &#8211; 2023</h2>



<hr class="wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity"/>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Four music videos commissioned by Albuquerque band <em>Castle Doctor</em>. Videos accompanied the release of their 2024 EP<em><a href="https://castledoctor.bandcamp.com/album/storming-the-palace" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Storming the Palace</a></em>. Videos and effects were created live during the recording of the EP using standard definition video equipment.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Camera OP and setup assistance from Tahj Sampson.</p>



